//│           params = Ls of
//│             ParamList: ‹empty›
//│           body = Return of Call:
//│             fun = SimpleRef of builtin:+⁰
//│             argss = Ls of
//│               Ls of
//│                 Arg:
//│                   value = Select{sym=term:A⁰/x⁰}:
//│                     qual = Select{sym=term:B⁰/A²}:
//│                       qual = This of class:B⁰
//│                       name = Ident of "A"
//│                     name = Ident of "x"
//│                 Arg:
//│                   value = Select{sym=term:B⁰/y¹}:
//│                     qual = This of class:B⁰
//│                     name = Ident of "y"
